       "            eps\n",
       "            <span class=\"param-doc-description\"\n",
       "            style=\"position-anchor: --doc-link-eps;\">\n",
       "            eps: float, default=0.5<br><br>The maximum distance between two samples for one to be considered<br>as in the neighborhood of the other. This is not a maximum bound<br>on the distances of points within a cluster. This is the most<br>important DBSCAN parameter to choose appropriately for your data set<br>and distance function. Smaller values generally lead to more clusters.</span>\n",
       "        </a>\n",
